# Browsers whose first language is Spanish (es, es-CL, es-419…) get the
# Spanish pages. Forced (!) because the English pages exist at these paths.
# The language switcher sets an nf_lang cookie, which Netlify reads in place of
# Accept-Language, so choosing English sticks. See src/layouts/Base.astro.
/                  /es/                  302!  Language=es
/xpcog             /es/xpcog             302!  Language=es
/acknowledgements  /es/acknowledgements  302!  Language=es
